OL,3,AOfcom outlines age check methods ahead
OL,4,Aof social media ban for under-16s
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfcom has set out its recommendations
OL,7,Ffor the most effective ways to identify
OL,8,Fwhich of the UK's millions of social
OL,9,Fmedia users are aged over 16.
OL,11,FUnder the UK's social media ban - which
OL,12,Fis due to come into force in March next
OL,13,Fyear - those under that age will be
OL,14,Fprevented from accessing ten of the
OL,15,Fbiggest platforms, including Instagram,
OL,16,FTikTok and Snapchat.
OL,18,FMany UK adults are also likely to have
OL,19,Fto confirm that they are not under-age
OL,20,Fby using one of the proposed measures,
OL,21,Fwhich are subject to government
OL,22,Fapproval.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
