OL,3,ARussell Brand's wife tells his rape
OL,4,Atrial he is 'kind and a wonderful
OL,5,Afather'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent.
OL,10,FRussell Brand's wife Laura has told a
OL,11,Fcourt her husband is "caring, kind and
OL,12,Fa wonderful father to our children".
OL,14,FThe 39-year-old told the jury at his
OL,15,Frape and sexual assault trial that "the
OL,16,Fway he treats me is to know me",
OL,17,Fadding: "I feel very seen by him... I
OL,18,Flove him very much."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
