OL,3,AGeorge Michael's Faith guitar sells for
OL,4,A#180k after auction row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe guitar George Michael performed
OL,7,Fwith in his 1987 Faith music video has
OL,8,Fsold for #180,000 at auction, after a
OL,9,Frow over the sale of memorabilia
OL,10,Frelated to the singer.
OL,12,FThe guitar was one of more than 30
OL,13,Fitems auctioned by Sworders from the
OL,14,Fcollection of Siobhan Bailey, Michael's
OL,15,Flong-time personal assistant. The sale
OL,16,Ffetched a total of #238,000 excluding
OL,17,Fbuyers' premium.
OL,19,FBailey died in 2014 and the items were
OL,20,Fsold by her estranged husband Ian
OL,21,FBelcher, who inherited them after her
OL,22,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793298000
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGeorge Michael's Faith guitar sells for
OL,4,A#180k after auction row
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerard Bailey, Siobhan's brother, told
OL,7,Fthe BBC she "would be horrified at the
OL,8,Fprospect of the auction being held in
OL,9,Fher name and that her personal,
OL,10,Fcherished possessions are being sold
OL,11,Foff to the highest bidder". Sworders
OL,12,Fand Belcher declined to comment.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
